<title>USA: TABLE- Plenum Publishing Q2 oper,net rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Plenum Publishing Q2 oper,net rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.39		    $0.80</p>
<p> Shr			   1.39		     0.85</p>
<p> Net			  5,328		    3,332</p>
<p> Revs			13,475		   12,358</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,840		    3,935</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.73		    $1.41</p>
<p> Shr			   1.73		     1.48</p>
<p> Net			  6,688		    5,812</p>
<p> Revs			25,763		   25,206</p>
<p> Avg			  3,857		    3,938</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Plenum Publishing Corp 1996 net earnings and per shareamounts include a $179,000 gain, or $0.05 a share, for the 1996 second quarter and a $250,000 gain, or $0.07 a share, for the 1996 first half from discontinued operations.</p>
